    "manage.help.gallery.manifest.actions": "Open the status link for the Gallery's Manifest tab to check it again and inspect differences. Batch Push always previews and rechecks before writing; it does not run automatically. Metadata writeback must be enabled for that library and the sidecar parent directory must be writable. Skipping differences skips locally changed files, while database-only changes can still be written.",
